      "comment": "DELTARIFFIC (5) is a progressive colt unbeaten this time in. Drew on the back row but worked to the front and kept going to record a commanding 7.7 metre win last start at Pinjarra. Facing a tougher task but is back on the front row and he has plenty of upside. MANUKA BAY NZ (4) has led to win her last two outings at this circuit and distance, one of them from a wider barrier than this. She should go forward again and is a big chance to land the hat trick. IN RARE AIR NZ (2) is heading the right way, improving last time out when she came from a wide barrier for second at this circuit and distance. Genuine threat from a better draw. MATERNAL DREAMS (6) draws wider but is worth thought off a last-start win at Pinjarra.",
